Read-only audit of /Users/sashaabramovich/live-spec. Do NOT edit. Return ≤650 words: ledger rows in EXACTLY this format, one per capability, citing SOURCE (file + heading + line), never prose summaries:
`capability | canonical owner | anchor | input | output | boundary ("does not do") | invocation/route | proof | state(working/partial/prose-only/stale)`

Domain: product-prover. Read skills/product-prover/SKILL.md (837 lines), skills/product-prover-pack/SKILL.md, editions/product-prover/SKILL.md headers, guardrails/check-prover-record.sh, docs/prover/ (count records, newest date). Cover as separate rows:
1. FULL review mode; 2. CROSS-LINK mode; 3. FEATURE-FIT mode (find each mode's defining heading/line);
4. **the class/lookalike lens — the prover's factual defect sweep across lookalikes**: find its exact heading and wording in the SKILL body (how it finds same-class/lookalike defects, what it takes as input, what verdict it emits). Quote the defining sentence with line number. State explicitly what it does NOT do (does it propose groupings/recommendations, or only sweep for factual defects?);
5. push-gate re-check (gate a);
6. the pack adapter (product-prover-pack): floor, mode-name binding, record shape;
7. "Overall confidence" verdict vocabulary (line);
8. stress-lenses reference file.
Also flag: any capability described in the body but never invoked by any route/gate; duplicate authority between skills/ copy and editions/ copy. Proof column: name real tests/gates or "none".
